  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "MovieGuys",
      "content": "Kate Beckinsale's lead character, Ada is about as intimidating as a bag of spinach, in this truly awful, tough girl action flick. \r\n\r\nThere is little to like here. An unoriginal story with a dash of casual misandry, meets what could best be described, as an unintentional satire of \"Lock, Stock and Two Smoking Barrels\". \r\n\r\nPerhaps the only upside, is the actions not wholly bad but it doesn't really make up, for this films deficits, in most other respects.\r\n\r\nIn summary, yet another hammy girl boss action flick, no one asked for, much less wanted.",
      "rating": 4,
      "createdAt": "2025-11-29T04:07:40Z"
    },
    {
      "author": "AbsoluteTube",
      "content": "Every character in this was brilliant, it could've been a good film if Kate wasn't walking about looking like a duck begging for bread in a park. Really offputting",
      "rating": null,
      "createdAt": "2025-11-29T17:47:19Z"
    }
  ],
